r_description\":\"The occurrence is located in Chapter XXIV of Alexandre Dumas fils’s La Dame aux camélias.\",\"supports\":\"Identifies the utterance as literary dialogue in the named work; the supplied metadata adds no evidence of a distinct undertaking or nonstandard core force.\",\"confidence\":0.99}],\"background_knowledge\":{\"used\":false,\"familiarity\":\"none\",\"confidence\":null,\"contribution\":null},\"ontology_assessment\":{\"fit\":\"natural\",\"diagnosis\":\"T naturally captures the core utterance as an emphatic avowal offered as a reason. Delivery-related intensity can remain contextual, with no residual pressure requiring P, E, or O.\",\"candidate_recurrent_dimension\":null},\"notes\":null}"
